# NOTE: the active .dockerignore for this image is the one at the build-context
# root (frontend/.dockerignore), because the canonical build command is
#   docker build -f frontend/web_app/Dockerfile frontend/
# This file is defense in depth: it applies if the build context is ever
# narrowed to web_app/.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/coverage
.git
.env*
*.log
*.tsbuildinfo
test-results*
playwright-report
